                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "(Will they be alive tomorrow?)",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I'm sorry if that question I asked last",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Scared you a bit like a hazmat, in a gas mask if you ask Zack",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "He's my brother, he likes when I rap fast",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "But let's backtrack, back to this",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Who would you live and die for on that list?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "But the problem is, there's another list that exists and no one really wants to think about this",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Forget sanity, forget salary, forget vanity, my morality",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "If you get in between someone I love and me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "You're gonna feel the heat of my cavalry",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "All these songs I'm hearin' are so heartless",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "Don't trust a perfect person and don't trust a song that's flawless",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
